sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Q as The question
    participant N as nvidia-smi
    participant K as kubectl
    participant D as dmesg / DCGM
    Q->>N: is the GPU busy, and with whose process?
    N-->>Q: utilisation, memory, and the PIDs holding it
    Q->>K: did the pod even get a GPU?
    K-->>Q: describe pod — allocation, events, admission failures
    Q->>D: is the hardware healthy?
    D-->>Q: XID errors, ECC counts, thermal throttling
    Note over N,D: ask in that order — allocation problems look exactly like performance problems from above
